WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.704 --> 00:00:06.725
A train sped along the tracks outside Metro City.

2
00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:15.508
train sped along the tracks outside Metro City.

3
00:00:16.948 --> 00:00:19.669
The train was carrying several animals from Metro City Zoo.

4
00:00:19.689 --> 00:00:25.811
"This will be an exciting zoo tour," said the train's engineer.

5
00:00:25.831 --> 00:00:28.352
"That's right," said the conductor.

6
00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:32.981
"Lots of people will get to see the special animals from the zoo."

7
00:00:33.001 --> 00:00:37.302
"People will really love Blue Baboon," said the engineer.

8
00:00:37.322 --> 00:00:40.203
"He's everybody's favorite—Oh no!

9
00:00:42.204 --> 00:00:43.304
Another train is coming!"

10
00:00:45.305 --> 00:00:51.066
Crash! Roxy and her friends were at Metro City Zoo.

11
00:00:52.066 --> 00:00:53.947
They were standing in front of the baboon exhibit.

12
00:00:54.887 --> 00:00:57.208
Roxy saw a small hill and lots of trees.

13
00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.285
But there was no baboon.

14
00:00:59.305 --> 00:01:04.970
"Blue Baboon left for the zoo tour today," said Mara.

15
00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:08.633
"I miss him already!"

16
00:01:08.653 --> 00:01:11.276
"Me too," said Terrell.

17
00:01:11.296 --> 00:01:13.838
"I hope he comes back soon.

18
00:01:14.518 --> 00:01:16.400
The zoo isn't much fun without him."

19
00:01:18.882 --> 00:01:20.884
The four friends walked through the bird exhibit.

20
00:01:21.845 --> 00:01:25.208
"The zoo still has lots of cool animals," said Roxy.

21
00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:29.010
She pointed at a brightly colored parrot.

22
00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:31.512
"I really like Parrot Pete."

23
00:01:31.532 --> 00:01:34.714
"Hello," said Parrot Pete.

24
00:01:35.775 --> 00:01:36.516
Roxy giggled.

25
00:01:36.536 --> 00:01:42.861
"Hello!" said Jack.

26
00:01:42.881 --> 00:01:44.522
"I see vultures!"

27
00:01:46.264 --> 00:01:47.004
Mara sighed.

28
00:01:47.024 --> 00:01:49.426
"All these birds are great.

29
00:01:50.307 --> 00:01:53.029
But Blue Baboon is my favorite animal."

30
00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.972
"Mine too," said Terrell.

31
00:01:56.992 --> 00:01:57.672
Jack shrugged.

32
00:01:58.473 --> 00:01:59.934
"He'll be back in a few months."

33
00:02:01.034 --> 00:02:02.635
Terrell's eyes suddenly lit up.

34
00:02:03.736 --> 00:02:04.836
"I have a great idea!"

35
00:02:05.056 --> 00:02:05.497
he said.

36
00:02:05.517 --> 00:02:10.179
"We can ask Rocket Girl to fly Blue Baboon home for visits!"

37
00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:12.821
"That would be awesome!"

38
00:02:13.821 --> 00:02:15.302
Mara pumped her fist in the air.

39
00:02:15.322 --> 00:02:18.824
"Then we wouldn't have to miss Blue Baboon at all!"

40
00:02:19.904 --> 00:02:21.005
Roxy rolled her eyes.

41
00:02:21.025 --> 00:02:24.927
"I doubt Rocket Girl can do that, Terrell."

42
00:02:26.008 --> 00:02:26.608
"Why not?"

43
00:02:26.908 --> 00:02:27.528
asked Terrell.

44
00:02:27.548 --> 00:02:29.850
"She can fly really fast!"

45
00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:32.411
"That's true," said Roxy.

46
00:02:32.431 --> 00:02:35.632
"But Rocket Girl isn't a taxi service.

47
00:02:36.813 --> 00:02:38.814
She has more important things to do."

48
00:02:39.594 --> 00:02:40.435
Terrell nodded.

49
00:02:40.455 --> 00:02:43.596
"Yeah, you're probably right."

50
00:02:46.478 --> 00:02:48.059
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

51
00:02:49.099 --> 00:02:50.400
She stepped away from her friends.

52
00:02:54.004 --> 00:02:56.945
She made sure they weren't looking and then pressed a button on the watch.

53
00:02:58.526 --> 00:02:59.806
Mayor Bloom's face appeared.

54
00:03:01.147 --> 00:03:01.967
He looked shocked.

55
00:03:01.987 --> 00:03:03.728
"Rocket Girl!"

56
00:03:03.968 --> 00:03:04.508
said the mayor.

57
00:03:04.528 --> 00:03:06.969
"There's been a terrible train crash!"

58
00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:08.670
"Oh no!"

59
00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:09.611
said Roxy.

60
00:03:09.631 --> 00:03:11.331
"Where did it happen?"

61
00:03:11.351 --> 00:03:14.813
"Just outside Metro City," said Mayor Bloom.

62
00:03:14.833 --> 00:03:18.834
"The train carrying the zoo animals crashed into another train.

63
00:03:19.815 --> 00:03:22.336
The second train was loaded with dangerous chemicals.

64
00:03:23.313 --> 00:03:24.516
I think we need your help!"

65
00:03:25.699 --> 00:03:26.481
Roxy gulped.

66
00:03:26.501 --> 00:03:28.366
"Don't worry, Mayor.

67
00:03:29.128 --> 00:03:30.251
I'm on my way!"
